# Vercel deploy allowlist — publish ONLY the built site + its config.
# Pattern: ignore everything, then re-include the two files that are safe to serve.
# This keeps internal coordination docs, the sealed data-clean/ graph, build
# scripts, and docs/EXCLUSION-TOKENS.txt OFF the public deployment by default —
# any new internal file added later is ignored automatically (deny-by-default).
*
!index.html
!vercel.json
